    {
      "question": "Where does this case stand right now, and what is outstanding?",
      "answer": "Stage: visit. Landlord approved (A1). A visit date is in the system (30/08/2025 10:00) but is not confirmed: the provider said Monday morning, 30/08 is a Saturday, and a different company phoned the tenant. Outstanding: provider confirmation of company, date and slot; tenant's correct contact; visit, result and any quote still to come."
    },
