      "question": "What is the next action, who is it for, and through which channel?",
      "answer": "Email to Keystone Compliance (A2) asking for written confirmation of company, date/slot and contact. Email to the tenant Clara (A3) saying the visit is not confirmed and asking for her best number. Job held until 2025-08-28 (A4)."
    },
